Origin and modifications

Fittr is a derivative work of "Pulse" (https://github.com/Luraxx/pulse),
Copyright 2026 Luraxx, which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The original copyright and attribution notice is retained here as the License
requires.

Modifications made by Sathvik Jammula (2026), all files changed accordingly:
  - Renamed and rebranded (app, targets, package, identifiers, bundle IDs).
  - Reworked the metric formulas: Banister-TRIMP strain, a bounded and shrunk
    biological-age model, a composite sleep score, stress and cardio-load
    estimates, and Google Health daily roll-ups for totals.
  - Added nutrition logging with targets, workout logging with strength sets,
    an AI coach and AI meal estimates (Apple on-device model or Claude).
  - New black user interface; English only.

